1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,415
What if you could control your computer, without touching it?

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:12,588
Meet Gestura. A hands-free desktop control system, powered by real-time computer vision.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,580
Move your index finger to control the cursor.

4
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,353
Pinch your fingers to click.

5
00:00:17,553 --> 00:00:19,051
Move your hand to scroll.

6
00:00:19,251 --> 00:00:23,675
Simple, intuitive gestures replace traditional mouse interactions.

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,885
Head tracking adds another layer of control.

8
00:00:26,985 --> 00:00:32,064
Turn your head to navigate between pages, and use simple movements to trigger actions.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:39,644
And when you need to type, Gestura brings up a virtual keyboard that you can control entirely through gestures.

10
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:45,592
One webcam. Real-time tracking. Complete hands-free interaction.

11
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:49,463
Gestura. Control your computer, without touching it.
